WEBVTT

01:01.670 --> 01:03.040
<b>Talk about close!</b>

01:03.040 --> 01:04.630
<b>Glad I dug that.</b>

01:07.710 --> 01:15.080
<b>At this very moment,
I'm working my way through another world alone!</b>

01:24.380 --> 01:27.790
<b>Loner With the Worst Skills</b>

01:24.710 --> 01:27.710
<b>Let's take things back to the day I got transported.</b>

01:28.330 --> 01:31.960
<b>I was spending lunch reading like always.</b>

01:33.460 --> 01:35.250
<b>All alone, as you can see.</b>

01:35.710 --> 01:37.750
<b>As anyone can see.</b>

01:38.710 --> 01:42.540
<b>Yup. I lived a loner life in the real world, too.</b>

01:43.210 --> 01:46.130
<b>Quit rubbing it in! You're not wrong, but still!</b>

01:46.830 --> 01:50.000
<b>So why was I alone? That's easy.</b>

01:50.170 --> 01:52.960
<b>Because I wanted nothing to do with my classmates.</b>

01:53.670 --> 01:55.580
<b>They'd get in the way of my books.</b>

01:56.420 --> 01:59.330
<b>If I had to divide up the class, it'd be...</b>

01:59.920 --> 02:00.960
<b>...the delinquents.</b>

02:02.330 --> 02:03.500
<b>The valley gal sort.</b>

02:04.880 --> 02:06.250
<b>The jocks.</b>

02:07.460 --> 02:08.630
<b>The nerds.</b>

02:09.670 --> 02:10.750
<b>The class reps.</b>

02:13.670 --> 02:16.000
<b>Then there's just... the rest.</b>

02:16.500 --> 02:19.540
<b>And me, not part of any group.</b>

02:22.580 --> 02:24.080
<b>That's when it happened.</b>

02:27.170 --> 02:27.750
<b>Holy crap!</b>

02:27.750 --> 02:28.460
<b>Wha-?!</b>

02:31.040 --> 02:32.710
<b>What is that?!</b>

02:42.290 --> 02:45.330
<b>A magic circle?! Just like the one
in the light novel I was reading?!</b>

02:45.500 --> 02:50.210
<b>I got excited for a quick second,
before realizing an isekai would be a pain in the ass.</b>

02:50.790 --> 02:52.880
<b>I'll stick to the sort in my books.</b>

02:53.250 --> 02:55.380
<b>Dunno who's doing this, but no thanks!</b>

02:56.290 --> 03:01.380
<b>It was like my body had a mind of its own,
trying desperately to leave the classroom.</b>

03:01.670 --> 03:03.080
<b>And it REALLY tried.</b>

03:04.210 --> 03:07.040
<b>Yeah, I figured. That's how these things go.</b>

03:10.750 --> 03:11.250
<b>No way!</b>

03:11.250 --> 03:12.500
<b>My body's disappearing!</b>

03:12.500 --> 03:13.630
<b>No freakin' way!</b>

03:13.830 --> 03:14.630
<b>Whadda we do?</b>

03:14.630 --> 03:15.380
<b>What's goin' on?!</b>

03:15.380 --> 03:17.000
<b>Gimme a freaking break!</b>

03:15.380 --> 03:16.170
<b>Are we...?</b>

03:20.330 --> 03:21.710
<b>Only one way out!</b>

03:21.710 --> 03:24.040
<b>My last hope was up into the ceiling.</b>

03:34.880 --> 03:37.670
<b>Phew, doubt it'll reach me up here...</b>

03:39.500 --> 03:41.790
<b>Noooo!</b>

03:46.040 --> 03:49.380
<b>Ugh, I'm in for it now.</b>

03:49.380 --> 03:51.580
<b>The ol' nothing-but-white room.</b>

03:52.130 --> 03:54.710
<b>So uhh, why is no one else here?</b>

03:54.960 --> 04:01.830
<b>Isn't there usually some fatso king or a beautiful princess
no geek would ever meet in real life?</b>

04:03.170 --> 04:06.210
<b>Hmm? That old guy's all alone like me.</b>

04:08.130 --> 04:10.790
<b>The old dude was in a panic.</b>

04:09.170 --> 04:10.500
<b>Why are you here?!</b>

04:10.500 --> 04:11.630
<b>Everyone's gone!</b>

04:10.790 --> 04:13.460
<b>Turns out he's some god in this place.</b>

04:11.920 --> 04:13.330
<b>Hurry and get ready!</b>

04:14.040 --> 04:17.080
<b>Apparently, the rest of the class
was out in the new world already.</b>

04:17.080 --> 04:19.210
<b>I was the only one left.</b>

04:19.210 --> 04:21.790
<b>Guess even the omniscient
overlooked my little escape route!</b>

04:22.540 --> 04:25.170
<b>He urged me to hurry.</b>

04:23.290 --> 04:24.960
<b>It's first-come first-served!</b>

04:25.170 --> 04:28.880
<b>And so I had to set my isekai stats and such.</b>

04:26.210 --> 04:27.830
<b>Got to set your stats!</b>

04:40.250 --> 04:45.580
<b>WEAPON ARTS</b>

04:40.250 --> 04:45.580
<b>IAIDO SWORDSMANSHIP</b>

04:40.250 --> 04:45.580
<b>DUAL BLADES</b>

04:40.250 --> 04:45.580
<b>GREATSWORDS</b>

04:40.250 --> 04:45.580
<b>SHIELDS</b>

04:40.250 --> 04:45.580
<b>COMET STRIKE</b>

04:40.260 --> 04:45.580
<b>DAGGERS</b>

04:40.330 --> 04:43.460
<b>Normally, each person gets 50 points to use</b>

04:43.460 --> 04:46.000
<b>on skills and magic and such.</b>

04:45.580 --> 04:46.250
<b>WEAPON ARTS</b>

04:45.580 --> 04:46.250
<b>IAIDO SWORDSMANSHIP</b>

04:45.580 --> 04:46.250
<b>DUAL BLADES</b>

04:45.590 --> 04:46.250
<b>GREATSWORDS</b>

04:45.590 --> 04:46.250
<b>SHIELDS</b>

04:45.590 --> 04:46.250
<b>COMET STRIKE</b>

04:45.590 --> 04:46.250
<b>DAGGERS</b>

04:46.420 --> 04:50.250
<b>But this was the old man's first time
roping in 43 people at once.</b>

04:50.250 --> 04:54.750
<b>SHIELD APTITUDE</b>

04:50.250 --> 04:54.750
<b>COMBAT APTITUDE</b>

04:50.250 --> 04:54.750
<b>BOW APTITUDE</b>

04:50.250 --> 04:54.750
<b>MAGIC APTITUDE</b>

04:50.250 --> 04:54.750
<b>DUMMY</b>

04:50.250 --> 04:54.750
<b>COMPANY COMMUNICATOR</b>

04:50.260 --> 04:54.750
<b>MASTER OF NONE</b>

04:50.460 --> 04:54.630
<b>Apparently, the OP skills were first-come first-served,
and the rest were all crap.</b>

04:55.500 --> 04:58.250
<b>Still, I figured I'd better take a good look.</b>

04:59.250 --> 05:06.130
<b>POINT</b>

04:59.250 --> 05:06.130
<b>ALLOCATION</b>

04:59.250 --> 05:06.130
<b>FOR STATS</b>

04:59.250 --> 05:06.130
<b>YOU MAY ALLOCATE 1 POINT TO EACH STAT</b>

04:59.250 --> 05:06.130
<b>OR ROLL DICE (10P FOR 2 DICE)</b>

04:59.380 --> 05:00.920
<b>Definitely not going for dice.</b>

05:01.330 --> 05:03.460
<b>Even if I got two sixes, that'd only put me at 12.</b>

05:03.750 --> 05:06.000
<b>What kind of moron would go for that?</b>

05:06.130 --> 05:15.420
<b>EQUIPMENT</b>

05:06.130 --> 05:15.420
<b>ITEMS</b>

05:06.130 --> 05:15.420
<b>PALADIN SET                                     GREAT SAGE SET</b>

05:06.130 --> 05:15.420
<b>VILLAGER A SET</b>

05:06.130 --> 05:15.420
<b>ALCHEMIST SET</b>

05:06.130 --> 05:15.420
<b>CONTACT LENSES</b>

05:06.130 --> 05:15.420
<b>BLACK KNIGHT SET</b>

05:06.130 --> 05:15.420
<b>RING                                   BERSERKER SET</b>

05:06.130 --> 05:15.420
<b>ANTIDOTE</b>

05:06.210 --> 05:09.130
<b>All that's left is a "Villager A Set" and "Contact Lenses"?!</b>

05:09.130 --> 05:11.920
<b>Who the heck is Villager A? Talk about lame!</b>

05:12.170 --> 05:15.250
<b>I wanted to be a Paladin or a Great Sage or something!</b>

05:15.420 --> 05:24.670
<b>MARTIAL ARTS</b>

05:15.420 --> 05:24.670
<b>DAGGERS</b>

05:15.420 --> 05:24.670
<b>COMET STRIKE</b>

05:15.420 --> 05:24.670
<b>SHIELDS  </b>

05:15.420 --> 05:24.670
<b>DEADLY BLOWS</b>

05:15.420 --> 05:24.670
<b>SPEARS</b>

05:15.420 --> 05:24.670
<b>STAVES</b>

05:15.420 --> 05:24.670
<b>TWO-HANDED SWORDS</b>

05:15.420 --> 05:24.670
<b>ONE-HANDED SWORDS</b>

05:15.430 --> 05:24.670
<b>ARCHERY</b>

05:15.500 --> 05:18.420
<b>"Staves"? A staff is basically just a stick!</b>

05:18.500 --> 05:19.920
<b>Do you just hit things with sticks?</b>

05:19.920 --> 05:21.500
<b>How do you survive an isekai like that?</b>

05:21.500 --> 05:24.380
<b>Gimme a sword or a spear or something!</b>

05:24.670 --> 05:33.290
<b>SKILL</b>

05:24.670 --> 05:33.290
<b>EXP BOOST</b>

05:24.670 --> 05:33.290
<b>PILLAGE</b>

05:24.670 --> 05:33.290
<b>HEIGHTENED INTUITION          SWORDSMANSHIP</b>

05:24.670 --> 05:33.290
<b>CLAIRVOYANCE</b>

05:24.670 --> 05:33.290
<b>WELL-BEING                        WALKING</b>

05:24.670 --> 05:33.290
<b>CALISTHENICS             SENSITIVITY</b>

05:24.670 --> 05:33.290
<b>SORCERY</b>

05:24.750 --> 05:27.580
<b>How are "Well-being" and "Walking" even skills?</b>

05:27.580 --> 05:28.830
<b>Is there nothing else?!</b>

05:29.080 --> 05:32.250
<b>I wanted something OP like Pillaging or Clairvoyance!</b>

05:33.290 --> 05:42.290
<b>MAGIC</b>

05:33.290 --> 05:42.290
<b>GRAND MAGIC                    FLAME         LIGHTNING            FIRE</b>

05:33.290 --> 05:42.290
<b>HEALING</b>

05:33.290 --> 05:42.290
<b>ELEMENTAL ASSIGNMENT</b>

05:33.300 --> 05:42.290
<b>ELEMENTAL BOOST                    DEATH                       CHARM</b>

05:33.300 --> 05:42.290
<b>TEMPERATURE             PACKING</b>

05:33.300 --> 05:42.290
<b>WEIGHT                      MOVEMENT</b>

05:33.300 --> 05:42.290
<b>DARK</b>

05:33.540 --> 05:36.170
<b>Of course the go-to Grand Magic is gone.</b>

05:36.830 --> 05:39.080
<b>No idea what the stuff left even does.</b>

05:39.380 --> 05:42.170
<b>How can there even be crap magic?</b>

05:42.290 --> 05:50.290
<b>SPECIAL</b>

05:42.290 --> 05:50.290
<b>SHIELD APTITUDE</b>

05:42.290 --> 05:50.290
<b>COMBAT APTITUDE</b>

05:42.290 --> 05:50.290
<b>MAGIC APTITUDE</b>

05:42.300 --> 05:50.290
<b>BOW APTITUDE</b>

05:42.300 --> 05:50.290
<b>COMPANY COMMUNICATOR</b>

05:42.300 --> 05:50.290
<b>MASTER OF NONE</b>

05:42.300 --> 05:50.290
<b>DUMMY</b>

05:42.460 --> 05:44.380
<b>What does "Company Communicator" even do?!</b>

05:44.380 --> 05:46.500
<b>Am I supposed to be an office worker, here?</b>

05:46.830 --> 05:50.170
<b>And how can "Dummy" be anything but bad?</b>

05:50.290 --> 05:56.920
<b>TITLE</b>

05:50.290 --> 05:56.920
<b>SAINT                                       FIEND SLAYER</b>

05:50.290 --> 05:56.920
<b> NEET</b>

05:50.290 --> 05:56.920
<b>SHUT-IN</b>

05:50.300 --> 05:56.920
<b>ILLUSIONIST                         TACTICIAN                               GUARDIAN</b>

05:50.500 --> 05:53.000
<b>Now shut-ins and NEETs?</b>

05:53.290 --> 05:56.790
<b>How are slackers gonna take down monsters?</b>

05:56.920 --> 06:00.880
<b>HEALTH</b>

05:56.920 --> 06:00.880
<b>WALKING</b>

05:56.920 --> 06:00.880
<b>CALISTHENICS</b>

05:56.920 --> 06:00.880
<b>SENSITIVITY</b>

05:57.000 --> 05:59.000
<b>Wait. That's it?</b>

06:00.960 --> 06:03.710
<b>There's crap, and then there's this.</b>

06:03.710 --> 06:06.170
<b>WHAT'S THE DEAL, OLD MAN?!</b>

06:06.290 --> 06:09.170
<b>Skills like these won't even get me through the first town!</b>

06:09.170 --> 06:11.710
<b>You gotta have better skills to choose from!</b>

06:11.710 --> 06:14.250
<b>Can you not even estimate
how many people you're summoning?</b>

06:14.250 --> 06:18.960
<b>And you call yourself a god?
Are you outta your mind? Seriously, are you?!</b>

06:19.250 --> 06:20.880
<b>By then, the old man was sick of my complaints.</b>

06:21.210 --> 06:27.290
<b>"Fine, take all the skills left! Now begone!" he said.</b>

06:33.040 --> 06:35.380
<b>TEMPERATURE   PACKING</b>

06:33.040 --> 06:35.380
<b>WEIGHT   MOVEMENT</b>

06:33.040 --> 06:35.380
<b>COMPANY COMMUNICATOR</b>

06:33.040 --> 06:35.380
<b>DUMMY</b>

06:33.050 --> 06:35.380
<b>WELL-BEING   WALKING</b>

06:33.050 --> 06:35.380
<b>CALISTHENICS SENSITIVITY</b>

06:35.880 --> 06:38.750
<b>So I wound up with all the leftover crap,</b>

06:38.750 --> 06:41.580
<b>and was basically guaranteed nightmare mode.</b>

06:48.960 --> 06:53.960
<b>He seriously teleported me...
How am I supposed to handle an isekai outta nowhere?</b>

06:54.330 --> 06:55.960
<b>I wasn't ready for this...</b>

06:55.960 --> 06:58.580
<b>Then again, I guess no one ever is.</b>

06:58.580 --> 06:59.130
<b>Huh?</b>

06:59.580 --> 07:01.080
<b>I guess this must be...</b>

07:03.130 --> 07:04.750
<b>...the Villager A Set.</b>

07:05.960 --> 07:09.380
<b>Wait, can this thing hold infinite items?</b>

07:09.500 --> 07:10.580
<b>Contacts                                                  Cloak                                          Leather Boots</b>

07:09.500 --> 07:10.580
<b>Wooden Stick</b>

07:10.580 --> 07:11.830
<b>Wooden Stick</b>

07:10.580 --> 07:11.830
<b>Ring of the Dead Soul</b>

07:11.830 --> 07:13.040
<b>Ring of the Dead Soul</b>

07:11.830 --> 07:13.040
<b>Jewel of Knowledge</b>

07:13.040 --> 07:14.000
<b>Jewel of Knowledge</b>

07:13.040 --> 07:14.000
<b>Villager A's Diary</b>

07:14.080 --> 07:17.330
<b>Still looks like a bunch of leftover crap, but...</b>

07:23.420 --> 07:24.880
<b>Not half bad!</b>

07:24.880 --> 07:27.540
<b>So! Now that I look good, how are my stats?</b>

07:27.750 --> 07:29.380
<b>Lemme just open "Check Stats," and...</b>

07:29.630 --> 07:32.750
<b>Please roll the dice</b>

07:30.710 --> 07:32.500
<b>What? Why dice?</b>

07:32.960 --> 07:34.330
<b>YOU MAY ALLOCATE 1 POINT TO EACH STAT</b>

07:32.960 --> 07:34.330
<b>OR ROLL DICE (10P FOR 2 DICE)</b>

07:34.420 --> 07:37.420
<b>That old fart really stuck me with EVERYTHING!</b>

07:37.630 --> 07:39.330
<b>Was he cleaning out stock or something?</b>

07:44.380 --> 07:46.500
<b>What the heck?! What does "M" mean?</b>

07:46.500 --> 07:48.080
<b>Please tell me it's not M for minus!</b>

07:48.540 --> 07:51.130
<b>Or maybe M for masochism?</b>

07:50.960 --> 07:53.210
<b>Certainly not that</b>

07:51.960 --> 07:53.210
<b>Nice retort!</b>

07:53.210 --> 07:54.710
<b>Which stat do you wish to allocate to?</b>

07:55.210 --> 07:56.500
<b>Uhh...</b>

07:56.500 --> 07:59.210
<b>Doesn't look like I'm gonna pull through
with any other strengths, so...</b>

08:00.000 --> 08:01.080
<b>Put it on Luck.</b>

08:01.000 --> 08:02.380
<b>Points allocated.</b>

08:01.000 --> 08:02.380
<b>Which stat do you wish</b>

08:01.000 --> 08:02.380
<b>to allocate to next?</b>

08:02.710 --> 08:06.210
<b>Forget worrying about balance! Time to go all in!</b>

08:06.880 --> 08:09.630
<b>Points allocated to Luck.</b>

08:06.880 --> 08:09.630
<b>Now calculating stats</b>

08:14.250 --> 08:17.250
<b>SPECIES:</b>

08:14.250 --> 08:17.250
<b>HUMAN</b>

08:14.250 --> 08:17.250
<b>MARTIAL ARTS:    CANE TECHNIQUE</b>

08:14.250 --> 08:17.250
<b>MAGIC:          TEMPERATURE         MOVE                 WEIGHT           PACKING</b>

08:14.250 --> 08:17.250
<b>SKILLS:              HEALTH           SENSITIVITY       CALISTHENICS     WALKING</b>

08:17.670 --> 08:21.830
<b>My Luck skill is off the charts. So M stood for Max?!</b>

08:22.250 --> 08:23.880
<b>RACE</b>

08:22.250 --> 08:23.880
<b>HUMAN</b>

08:22.630 --> 08:25.830
<b>The rest is still all crap.</b>

08:23.880 --> 08:29.250
<b>MARTIAL ARTS:     CANE TECHNIQUE</b>

08:23.880 --> 08:29.250
<b>MAGIC:        TEMPERATURE      MOVE              WEIGHT           PACKING</b>

08:23.880 --> 08:29.250
<b>SKILLS:        HEALTH             SENSITIVITY        CALISTHENICS      WALKING</b>

08:23.880 --> 08:29.250
<b>TITLE:                 SHUT-IN                       NEET                 LONER</b>

08:23.880 --> 08:29.250
<b>COMPANY COMMUNICATOR   MASTER OF NONE        DUMMY</b>

08:23.880 --> 08:29.250
<b>EQUIPMENT: CLOTH BAG</b>

08:26.670 --> 08:28.880
<b>Wait, there are two extra.</b>

08:29.250 --> 08:35.250
<b>Subjugate                                                                 Loner</b>

08:29.250 --> 08:35.250
<b>SUBJUGATE OTHERS TO FOLLOW YOUR COMMAND                                                            MUST SURVIVE ALONE.</b>

08:29.250 --> 08:35.250
<b>CANNOT FORM PARTY.</b>

08:29.250 --> 08:35.250
<b>Additional Ability</b>

08:29.250 --> 08:35.250
<b>IF YOU WANT</b>

08:29.250 --> 08:35.250
<b>TO MAKE FRIENDS</b>

08:29.330 --> 08:31.040
<b>Is that because I got pulled in alone?</b>

08:31.500 --> 08:35.130
<b>Apparently, when you're a loner
you can use the subjugate skill.</b>

08:35.330 --> 08:37.250
<b>Stuck alone in another world, huh?</b>

08:37.250 --> 08:39.790
<b>There go my chances of an isekai harem.</b>

08:40.330 --> 08:42.580
<b>Why's no one else around, though?</b>

08:42.790 --> 08:45.630
<b>Everyone shoulda been sucked in here with me.</b>

08:46.880 --> 08:50.130
<b>Ah, who cares? Can't form a party anyway!</b>

08:51.630 --> 08:55.290
<b>Only thing I gotta worry about now
is setting up somewhere safe.</b>

08:55.830 --> 08:58.040
<b>Then I just need to find some food.</b>

08:58.420 --> 09:01.250
<b>Time to make myself a home!</b>

09:08.330 --> 09:11.540
<b>Hard to see anything stuck in these woods, though.</b>

09:15.460 --> 09:17.920
<b>If a monster rolled up on me now, I'd be done for.</b>

09:17.920 --> 09:20.710
<b>Dunno if my well-honed fake sleeping ability
would do me any good.</b>

09:21.420 --> 09:24.790
<b>Oh, yeah! I still haven't tried those contacts.</b>

09:29.040 --> 09:30.420
<b>Whoa!</b>

09:31.080 --> 09:33.580
<b>Nuts</b>

09:31.960 --> 09:34.420
<b>These don't just let me see things!</b>

09:32.080 --> 09:33.580
<b>Phsyical Strength Mushroom</b>

09:32.580 --> 09:33.580
<b>Nuts</b>

09:33.580 --> 09:34.830
<b>Medicinal Herbs</b>

09:33.580 --> 09:34.830
<b>Nuts</b>

09:34.090 --> 09:34.830
<b>Potenshroom</b>

09:34.920 --> 09:36.210
<b>They let me see EVERYTHING!</b>

09:35.210 --> 09:37.830
<b>Antidote</b>

09:35.580 --> 09:37.830
<b>Potion</b>

09:36.330 --> 09:37.540
<b>Clear as day!</b>

09:37.920 --> 09:40.130
<b>How do these even work?</b>

09:40.920 --> 09:43.880
<b>These contacts give me the Appraisal skill?</b>

09:43.880 --> 09:46.630
<b>This brings a lot into focus!</b>

09:44.080 --> 09:46.830
<b>CONTACTS</b>

09:44.080 --> 09:46.830
<b>APPRAISAL: ABILITY TO JUDGE ALL VISIBLE THINGS</b>

09:44.090 --> 09:46.830
<b>Potenshroom</b>

09:44.090 --> 09:46.830
<b>Edible. Boosts potential capacities.</b>

09:48.880 --> 09:52.040
<b>My Appraisal skill opened up a whole new world.</b>

09:54.710 --> 09:57.630
<b>Potenshroom</b>

09:55.670 --> 09:57.170
<b>And made things more fun!</b>

09:56.130 --> 09:57.170
<b>Whoa!</b>

09:57.630 --> 10:00.460
<b>Bird</b>

09:57.630 --> 10:00.460
<b>Nuts</b>

09:57.630 --> 10:00.460
<b>Medicinal Herb</b>

09:57.630 --> 10:00.460
<b>Potenshroom</b>

10:00.460 --> 10:04.250
<b>Bird</b>

10:00.460 --> 10:04.250
<b>Antidote Herb</b>

10:00.460 --> 10:04.250
<b>Medicinal Herb</b>

10:00.460 --> 10:04.250
<b>Bird</b>

10:00.460 --> 10:04.250
<b>Nuts</b>

10:00.460 --> 10:04.250
<b>Potenshroom</b>

10:00.460 --> 10:04.250
<b>Medicinal Herb</b>

10:00.470 --> 10:04.250
<b>Potenshroom</b>

10:04.420 --> 10:05.710
<b>Wow, look at these!</b>

10:07.710 --> 10:10.460
<b>Potenshroom</b>

10:07.710 --> 10:10.460
<b>EDIBLE.     BOOSTS POTENTIAL CAPACITIES.</b>

10:08.710 --> 10:10.460
<b>Edible mushrooms!</b>

10:11.040 --> 10:15.000
<b>My bag could hold everything I found,
and I had potions packed in already.</b>

10:15.420 --> 10:18.630
<b>I really should apologize
for talking down the Villager A Set.</b>

10:20.250 --> 10:22.960
<b>I feel like I can find anything out here...</b>

10:22.960 --> 10:23.790
<b>Hmm?</b>

10:46.670 --> 10:48.040
<b>Delish!</b>

10:49.290 --> 10:49.960
<b>Huh?</b>

11:01.420 --> 11:02.580
<b>A cave?</b>

11:06.500 --> 11:08.330
<b>Anyone home?</b>

11:11.540 --> 11:15.380
<b>Sorry for intruding if this is your home, monsters.</b>

11:15.380 --> 11:17.000
<b>Really hope it's not, though!</b>

11:29.710 --> 11:32.040
<b>Nice and spacious.</b>

11:32.670 --> 11:41.170
<b>Magic Tent</b>

11:32.670 --> 11:41.170
<b>CAN BE DEPLOYED OR PACKED UP USING MAGIC.</b>

11:32.670 --> 11:41.170
<b>REMAINS ROOM TEMPERATURE.</b>

11:32.670 --> 11:41.170
<b>WARDS OFF BUGS AND MONSTERS</b>

11:32.670 --> 11:41.170
<b>Magic Lantern</b>

11:32.670 --> 11:41.170
<b>CAN BE LIT, SET TO FLASH,</b>

11:32.670 --> 11:41.170
<b>OR EXTINGUISHED USING MAGIC.</b>

11:32.670 --> 11:41.170
<b>WARDS OFF BUGS AND MONSTERS.</b>

11:33.540 --> 11:36.210
<b>Got a tent and a lamp in my bag, already.</b>

11:36.580 --> 11:39.710
<b>Already feelin' like settling in.</b>

11:42.290 --> 11:44.460
<b>Gathered up some wood and leaves.</b>

11:44.460 --> 11:46.920
<b>Now to just use my Temperature magic and...</b>

11:47.920 --> 11:50.290
<b>That should keep the beasts away.</b>

11:51.210 --> 11:53.880
<b>This leftover magic isn't so bad!</b>

11:58.000 --> 12:00.710
<b>Lemme just check my stats before I pass out.</b>

12:01.080 --> 12:04.580
<b>MAGIC</b>

12:01.080 --> 12:04.580
<b>Temperature   Movement   Weight</b>

12:01.090 --> 12:04.580
<b>Packing        Fire Magic</b>

12:01.460 --> 12:04.960
<b>Nice, my Temperature skill leveled up
and I got "Fire Magic".</b>

12:04.580 --> 12:08.960
<b>MAGIC</b>

12:04.580 --> 12:08.960
<b>Temperature   Movement   Weight</b>

12:04.590 --> 12:08.960
<b>Packing        Fire Magic</b>

12:04.590 --> 12:08.960
<b>SKILLS</b>

12:04.590 --> 12:08.960
<b>Well-Being      Sensitivity       Calisthenics</b>

12:04.590 --> 12:08.960
<b>Walking           Subjugation         Appraisal</b>

12:04.590 --> 12:08.960
<b>Clairvoyance    Perception    Enemy Detection</b>

12:05.290 --> 12:08.830
<b>Got Clairvoyance, Perception,
and "Enemy Detection", too.</b>

12:11.830 --> 12:15.170
<b>I did make sure there were no baddies around...</b>

12:16.130 --> 12:19.330
<b>But what if they show up...?</b>

12:19.830 --> 12:23.880
<b>All I can do is hit them with a stick...</b>

12:24.580 --> 12:29.830
<b>And just like that I finished my first day
as a loner in another world.</b>

12:35.290 --> 12:37.080
<b>DAY 2</b>

12:37.170 --> 12:39.880
<b>Whew, made it through the night no problem.</b>

12:40.330 --> 12:42.750
<b>My items got a bonus monster repellent effect.</b>

12:42.920 --> 12:46.210
<b>All thanks to that "Shut-in" title I got.</b>

12:46.330 --> 12:47.630
<b>Nice going, shut-ins!</b>

12:46.420 --> 12:48.170
<b>SHUT-IN:</b>

12:46.420 --> 12:48.170
<b>SHUT SELF IN</b>

12:46.420 --> 12:48.170
<b>PROTECTS LIVING SPACE.</b>

12:50.290 --> 12:52.750
<b>My stomach's not fairing so well, though.</b>

12:53.210 --> 12:57.040
<b>Time to light a fire with my new magic.</b>

13:01.670 --> 13:05.790
<b>And mix the mushrooms I gathered
with the cured meat in my bag.</b>

13:07.040 --> 13:09.420
<b>Add a little flavor, aaand...</b>

13:12.290 --> 13:14.040
<b>Breakfast is served!</b>

13:17.880 --> 13:20.960
<b>Delish! Gotta hand it to myself!</b>

13:23.000 --> 13:29.830
<b>Didn't expect to have a pan and a knife.
The Villager A Set is doing wonders.</b>

13:30.790 --> 13:33.670
<b>Did this A guy really live in a village, though?</b>

13:33.790 --> 13:36.210
<b>He's more like some wilderness survivor.</b>

13:37.040 --> 13:41.290
<b>Forget that, though.
Gotta figure out where I go from here.</b>

13:45.920 --> 13:48.460
<b>That cave should work as a home for now.</b>

13:48.790 --> 13:52.080
<b>Next up is finding food and working on security.</b>

13:53.960 --> 13:55.580
<b>Stamina Caps</b>

13:55.580 --> 13:59.040
<b>Medicinal Herb</b>

13:59.330 --> 14:01.460
<b>The real problem will be monsters...</b>

14:02.540 --> 14:04.540
<b>PERCEPTION</b>

14:12.630 --> 14:14.540
<b>The time's come, huh?</b>

14:14.880 --> 14:17.040
<b>Not one, but two goblins.</b>

14:17.330 --> 14:23.330
<b>GOBLIN B</b>

14:17.330 --> 14:23.330
<b>GOBLIN A</b>

14:20.500 --> 14:23.420
<b>They should be pushover mobs,
but those are some high stats!</b>

14:23.750 --> 14:24.960
<b>Can I win this?</b>

14:25.880 --> 14:29.630
<b>I mean, out here I'm gonna have to fight eventually.</b>

14:30.000 --> 14:31.130
<b>This could be my chance.</b>

14:31.460 --> 14:33.420
<b>Not so sure about this stick, though...</b>

14:33.420 --> 14:37.000
<b>Maybe I can try using "Packing"
to pack it full of magical energy.</b>

14:34.210 --> 14:39.040
<b>PACKING</b>

14:34.210 --> 14:39.040
<b>To pack various things with magic.</b>

14:34.210 --> 14:39.040
<b>It can have a wide range of effects.</b>

14:39.420 --> 14:42.170
<b>Sweet. Worked better than I thought.</b>

14:42.580 --> 14:46.830
<b>Forget OP skills, I can make myself OP!</b>

15:04.880 --> 15:06.790
<b>Right, one more to go.</b>

15:10.080 --> 15:11.540
<b>It's attacks are simple.</b>

15:12.670 --> 15:13.580
<b>Easy enough to read!</b>

15:41.710 --> 15:43.670
<b>I survived my first battle.</b>

15:45.000 --> 15:49.540
<b>It wasn't perfect, but I did good.
Passed with flying colors.</b>

15:52.500 --> 15:56.210
<b>Took more mental damage than physical out there...</b>

16:04.670 --> 16:07.960
<b>Club</b>

16:04.670 --> 16:07.960
<b>A CLUB MADE OUT OF WOOD</b>

16:05.080 --> 16:07.540
<b>I brought back one of the goblin clubs.</b>

16:07.960 --> 16:11.500
<b>That it? This thing's short, heavy, and useless.</b>

16:11.500 --> 16:13.460
<b>My stick's good enough for now.</b>

16:14.210 --> 16:16.290
<b>All right, let's see, then...</b>

16:16.290 --> 16:20.290
<b>RACE</b>

16:16.290 --> 16:20.290
<b>HUMAN</b>

16:17.790 --> 16:20.170
<b>Nice! I leveled up!</b>

16:20.580 --> 16:23.500
<b>Whoa! And my stats basically doubled!</b>

16:23.880 --> 16:25.750
<b>My Staves skill went up!</b>

16:26.040 --> 16:28.210
<b>Just from smashing things with my stick?</b>

16:27.880 --> 16:29.960
<b>MARTIAL ARTS:   STAVES              EVASION        ENEMY DETECTION     MAGIC WRAP</b>

16:27.880 --> 16:29.960
<b>MAGIC:     TEMPERATURE      MOVEMENT         WEIGHT         PACKING       FIRE MAGIC</b>

16:27.880 --> 16:29.960
<b>SKILLS:           WELL-BEING    SENSITIVITY     CALISTHENICS    WALKING      SUBJUGATE</b>

16:27.880 --> 16:29.960
<b>TITLE:                 SHUT-IN                     NEET                   LONER</b>

16:27.880 --> 16:29.960
<b>COMPANY COMMUNICATOR    MASTER OF NONE     DUMMY</b>

16:27.880 --> 16:29.960
<b>WOODEN STICK  PLAIN CLOTHES   LEATHER GLOVES   LEATHER BOOTS   CAPE</b>

16:28.210 --> 16:30.000
<b>Huh? My Sensitivity skill, too?</b>

16:30.420 --> 16:35.380
<b>Don't even need to get captured by goblins
and tormented like some poor lady knight?</b>

16:35.460 --> 16:39.960
<b>MARTIAL ARTS:   STAVES              EVASION        ENEMY DETECTION     MAGIC WRAP</b>

16:35.460 --> 16:39.960
<b>MAGIC:        TEMPERATURE        MOVEMENT         WEIGHT               PACKING           FIRE MAGIC</b>

16:35.460 --> 16:39.960
<b>SKILLS:              WELL-BEING       SENSITIVITY        CALISTHENICS    WALKING         SUBJUGATE</b>

16:35.460 --> 16:39.960
<b>TITLE:                    SHUT-IN                        NEET                     LONER</b>

16:35.460 --> 16:39.960
<b>COMPANY COMMUNICATOR    MASTER OF NONE     DUMMY</b>

16:35.460 --> 16:39.960
<b>WOODEN STICK  PLAIN CLOTHES   LEATHER GLOVES   LEATHER BOOTS   CAPE</b>

16:35.830 --> 16:37.380
<b>Got something called "Magic Wrap," too?</b>

16:37.380 --> 16:39.460
<b>Maybe from packing magic into my stick?</b>

16:40.250 --> 16:41.920
<b>Leveled up Calisthenics, too!</b>

16:41.920 --> 16:43.750
<b>Must be cause I always do my morning stretches!</b>

16:44.380 --> 16:46.630
<b>Err, as of today, at least...</b>

16:48.460 --> 16:51.460
<b>DAY 3</b>

16:53.540 --> 16:55.920
<b>I am so done with mushrooms...</b>

16:55.920 --> 16:58.830
<b>I could really go for some meat, but...</b>

16:59.170 --> 17:02.210
<b>I bet the Class Rep wouldn't approve.</b>

17:02.460 --> 17:03.960
<b>SAY NO</b>

17:02.460 --> 17:03.960
<b>TO INDULGENCE!</b>

17:09.130 --> 17:12.080
<b>'Kay! First things first, I gotta toughen myself up.</b>

17:12.290 --> 17:15.210
<b>My new Magic Wrap ability</b>

17:15.250 --> 17:21.250
<b>MAGIC WRAP LV 1:</b>

17:15.580 --> 17:21.130
<b>can boost my physical abilities plus my physical and
magic defense, putting most other skill sets to shame!</b>

17:21.250 --> 17:25.000
<b>Magic Wrap</b>

17:21.250 --> 17:25.000
<b>Corner</b>

17:21.580 --> 17:24.580
<b>The isekai housewives would line up
for a bargain like this!</b>

17:27.790 --> 17:31.500
<b>Wait, my Appraisal skill leveled up, too...</b>

17:31.000 --> 17:33.790
<b>LEATHER GLOVES ?</b>

17:31.500 --> 17:33.790
<b>CAPE ?</b>

17:32.250 --> 17:33.790
<b>WOODEN STICK ?</b>

17:33.130 --> 17:34.960
<b>So what's with all these question marks?</b>

17:34.960 --> 17:36.630
<b>Seems worse to me.</b>

17:39.710 --> 17:42.630
<b>Whatever. Forget about it!</b>

17:42.630 --> 17:45.130
<b>Let's go out and have some fun! Yessiree!</b>

17:45.130 --> 17:47.500
<b>Time to practice magic now, one-two-three!</b>

17:51.830 --> 17:54.380
<b>All right! Nature's bounty is mine!</b>

17:57.750 --> 17:59.420
<b>Ugh! No more mushrooms!</b>

17:59.960 --> 18:02.880
<b>Where does all the meat grow, huh? Where?!</b>

18:04.670 --> 18:07.250
<b>Wait, forget the mushrooms, it's magic time!</b>

18:09.420 --> 18:11.290
<b>What am I even doing?</b>

18:12.460 --> 18:13.790
<b>Magic Wrap.</b>

18:19.540 --> 18:20.750
<b>Feels like that worked.</b>

18:32.670 --> 18:33.710
<b>Light as a feather!</b>

18:35.750 --> 18:38.080
<b>So fast it's like warping!</b>

18:41.710 --> 18:44.790
<b>Whoa! And my attacks are faster than ever!</b>

18:48.170 --> 18:49.880
<b>Now for some tougher goblins!</b>

18:48.460 --> 18:49.960
<b>GOBLIN C</b>

18:48.960 --> 18:49.960
<b>GOBLIN D</b>

18:54.920 --> 18:56.420
<b>Piece of cake!</b>

18:56.750 --> 18:59.710
<b>So long as there's only two, they don't stand a chance!</b>

19:00.210 --> 19:02.500
<b>I'm already doing way better than yesterday!</b>

19:02.920 --> 19:05.130
<b>Bet I could even handle three!</b>

19:13.920 --> 19:16.330
<b>Maybe I'll let them off this time.</b>

19:16.330 --> 19:19.080
<b>Gotta head home and practice my magic.</b>

19:20.130 --> 19:26.130
<b>Fight</b>

19:20.130 --> 19:26.130
<b>Items</b>

19:20.130 --> 19:26.130
<b>Magic</b>

19:20.130 --> 19:26.130
<b>Run</b>

19:20.130 --> 19:26.130
<b>Haruka</b>

19:20.130 --> 19:26.130
<b>Goblin A</b>

19:20.130 --> 19:26.130
<b>Goblin B</b>

19:21.380 --> 19:23.630
<b>From there on it was goblin hunting by day,</b>

19:26.170 --> 19:27.880
<b>and magic research by night.</b>

19:28.500 --> 19:31.880
<b>Or maybe more like DIY time? Just lots of trial and error.</b>

19:32.750 --> 19:34.330
<b>Until day five.</b>

19:35.630 --> 19:38.420
<b>When I beat a goblin in one hit!</b>

19:39.170 --> 19:41.880
<b>Decorated my base a bit, too.</b>

19:42.710 --> 19:45.460
<b>Feels like I've got the hang of this isekai thing.</b>

19:47.130 --> 19:49.130
<b>Now to just keep it up.</b>

19:51.750 --> 19:55.670
<b>YES! Meat at last!</b>

19:55.920 --> 19:57.170
<b>Get back here!</b>

19:57.540 --> 20:01.380
<b>A little meaty-treat, at last!</b>

20:01.960 --> 20:03.080
<b>Gotcha!</b>

20:12.830 --> 20:14.670
<b>PERCEPTION</b>

20:12.920 --> 20:14.670
<b>That was no goblin...</b>

20:19.750 --> 20:21.170
<b>Are those...?</b>

20:22.540 --> 20:23.830
<b>Ugh...</b>

20:26.330 --> 20:29.790
<b>Of course it has to be the class delinquents...</b>

20:30.380 --> 20:33.040
<b>I don't want anything to do with them.</b>

20:36.000 --> 20:37.170
<b>Wait.</b>

20:37.330 --> 20:40.500
<b>There might be someone over there.</b>

20:40.790 --> 20:41.960
<b>Clairvoyance!</b>

20:48.630 --> 20:51.880
<b>Next it's the gal gang? You gotta be kidding!</b>

20:53.670 --> 20:55.670
<b>And over there are the jocks?</b>

20:55.670 --> 20:57.420
<b>Definitely don't wanna bump into them!</b>

20:59.290 --> 21:03.080
<b>Even the nerds? I mean,
we used to talk sometimes, but...</b>

21:03.080 --> 21:03.920
<b>no thanks!</b>

21:10.080 --> 21:11.580
<b>The class rep...</b>

21:17.420 --> 21:19.500
<b>This world is a vicious place.</b>

21:19.960 --> 21:22.250
<b>I know it's better to have companions.</b>

21:23.130 --> 21:27.250
<b>I've known the class rep
since our first day at elementary school, too.</b>

21:27.710 --> 21:29.880
<b>Maybe I could just...</b>

21:35.040 --> 21:37.380
<b>But, no...</b>

21:38.710 --> 21:41.670
<b>All this freedom and isolation.</b>

21:42.540 --> 21:45.710
<b>No one to tell me what to do!</b>

21:46.670 --> 21:50.290
<b>Nothing can beat a life like this!</b>

21:52.000 --> 21:54.290
<b>That's it! Of course it is!</b>

21:54.580 --> 21:55.420
<b>I...</b>

21:55.830 --> 21:56.920
<b>I am...</b>

21:58.250 --> 22:03.080
<b>...gonna master this world alone!</b>
